{
  "title": "Delivery Knight",
  "description": "Devastating air pollution and severe social divide between residents and refugees. A corrupt, unforgiving and violent social order. This is the world Sa-Wol was born into. After watching the police massacre her mother and adopted family simply because they were refugees, Sa-Wol holds a deep-seeded rage and fear of the police. Sa-Wol believes that becoming a delivery agent is the only means to liberate herself, but can she beat the odds stacked up against her to become one? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Conspiracy, Corrupt Organizations, Drama, Dystopian, Female Protagonist, Future, Human Experiment, Male Demographic with Female Lead, Martial Arts, Mutants, Mutation, Pollution, Post-Apocalyptic, Sci-Fi, Smart Female Lead, Strong Female Lead, Supernatural, Adapted to KDrama, Adapted to Live Action, Female Empowerment, Female Lead, Full Color, Longstrip, Manhwa, Web Comic, Class Struggle, Ecology",
  "artist": "Yun-Gyun Lee",
  "author": "Yun-Gyun Lee",
